    "text": "Skip to content\nalgaeair\n®\nThe idea\nThe living loop\nTry the response\nBUILT TO BREATHE\nExplore the pod\nNATURE, WITH A LITTLE INTELLIGENCE.\nA little algae.\nA better atmosphere.\n\nA new atmosphere is just a scroll away.\n\nMeet the pod\nA WINDOW TO BETTER AIR\n\nKeep going. There’s something living on the other side.\n\nINTRODUCING / ALGAEAIR AA–01\nMeet your\nliving air pod.\n\nMicroalgae at the core. Intelligence in the loop.\nA small prototype for a fresher possibility.\n\nDiscover AlgaeAir\nSee it respond\nBIOLOGY × SENSORS × CLOUD\nSCROLL TO DESCEND\n01 / ABOVE THE CLOUDS\nBIOLOGY AT THE CORE\n✳\nCLOUD IN THE LOOP\n✳\nBETTER AIR IN MIND\n✳\nSMALL BY DESIGN.\n01 / THE IDEA\nA FRESH WAY TO THINK ABOUT AIR\nWhat if better air\ncould grow?\n\nOn bad-air days, a classroom window becomes a difficult choice. Fresh air outside isn’t always fresh.\n\nAlgaeAir explores a different possibility: a compact microalgae bioreactor that responds to the environment around it. A little light, a little air, and a connected system that h"
